{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Pet Hooligan is a vibrant, satirical, 3rd person shooter-platformer filled with cartoon chaos and destruction with both PvP and PvE experiences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/fe4df65c119ff9ce187682b44ce50a9d.avif?t=1758906711\" width=616 height=212 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platform across the city to find new vantage points to eliminate your enemies. Skateboard like a pro-skater and build trick combos to boost your traversal speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/b9cad3b295f529c76fdb89876bcc499a.poster.avif?t=1758906711\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/b9cad3b295f529c76fdb89876bcc499a.webm?t=1758906711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/b9cad3b295f529c76fdb89876bcc499a.mp4?t=1758906711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/824e32e64531653bf16c9f0a097ce076.avif?t=1758906711\" width=616 height=232 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate enemies with an arsenal of comical weapons from flamethrowers to toilet plungers. Destroy the cars, crates, and barrels for extra explodey chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/758f34084752bf08642b9cad8274577a.poster.avif?t=1758906711\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/758f34084752bf08642b9cad8274577a.webm?t=1758906711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/758f34084752bf08642b9cad8274577a.mp4?t=1758906711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/cd55ddf88debe2f82328a0ff3f10196f.avif?t=1758906711\" width=616 height=210 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pledge allegiance to one of seven factions, from the athletic Rogue Jumpers to the bionic Cypherbuns. Raise the ranks and unlock unique perks to aid you in your battle for control over Hooliland City.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/5747e44725a496845edea18b63d242f9.poster.avif?t=1758906711\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/5747e44725a496845edea18b63d242f9.webp?t=1758906711\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=347 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/f34d9c4b44e79a2212b2ed1c324f7310.avif?t=1758906711\" width=616 height=216 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put your abilities to the test with both PvP and PvE experiences. Play with friends in a variety of modes including: Sandbox, Free-for-All, and Team Deathmatch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/8f72c58285778d597ddb39b557d7d388.poster.avif?t=1758906711\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/8f72c58285778d597ddb39b557d7d388.webm?t=1758906711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/8f72c58285778d597ddb39b557d7d388.mp4?t=1758906711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/7cd9ee09d0a28fe5e673ffe065b4e01e.avif?t=1758906711\" width=616 height=206 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Hooligan and flex your sick drip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/c8ac4824459b874bb2fd992885a5452c.poster.avif?t=1758906711\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/c8ac4824459b874bb2fd992885a5452c.webm?t=1758906711\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/extras/c8ac4824459b874bb2fd992885a5452c.mp4?t=1758906711\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574840?t=1758906711","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574840?t=1758906711","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574840/5baf00a9a25c638aa0605a2839a89d7f0e999aa2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758906711","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor